{"id":"e861777307dc3417","group":"58","path":"58/batch06/58-df-separable.md","title":"Separable","display":"df-separable — Separable","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-separable","aliases":["58-df-separable","Separable"],"display":"df-separable — Separable","depends_on":["[[../batch12/58-df-topological-space.md]]","[[../batch14/58-df-countable.md]]","[[../batch13/58-df-zfc-top5-closure.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-separable"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-separable</span><span>Separable</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-separable — Separable"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"815e63e5071e7b58\" href=\"?note=815e63e5071e7b58\" title=\"../batch12/58-df-topological-space.md\">../batch12/58-df-topological-space.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"1b3610e6aed65b25\" href=\"?note=1b3610e6aed65b25\" title=\"../batch14/58-df-countable.md\">../batch14/58-df-countable.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"9ac97ecaeb21258a\" href=\"?note=9ac97ecaeb21258a\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-zfc-top5-closure.md\">../batch13/58-df-zfc-top5-closure.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X,\\tau,D\\in V\">\\(X,\\tau,D\\in V\\)</span> (参数)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S\">\\(\\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S\\)</span> (拓扑空间谓词, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"815e63e5071e7b58\" href=\"?note=815e63e5071e7b58\" title=\"../batch12/58-df-topological-space.md\">../batch12/58-df-topological-space.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Countable}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Countable}_S\\)</span> (可数谓词, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"1b3610e6aed65b25\" href=\"?note=1b3610e6aed65b25\" title=\"../batch14/58-df-countable.md\">../batch14/58-df-countable.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcTop5Closure}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcTop5Closure}_S\\)</span> (闭包关系, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"9ac97ecaeb21258a\" href=\"?note=9ac97ecaeb21258a\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-zfc-top5-closure.md\">../batch13/58-df-zfc-top5-closure.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Separable}_S\\subseteq V^2\">\\(\\mathrm{Separable}_S\\subseteq V^2\\)</span> (本文件定义的可分性谓词)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}separable}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Separable}_S(X,\\tau)\\leftrightarrow\n\\left(\\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S(X,\\tau)\\land\n\\exists D\\subseteq X\\;(\\mathrm{Countable}_S(D)\\land\n\\mathrm{ZfcTop5Closure}_S(X,\\tau,D,X))\\right)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}separable}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Separable}_S(X,\\tau)\\leftrightarrow\n\\left(\\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S(X,\\tau)\\land\n\\exists D\\subseteq X\\;(\\mathrm{Countable}_S(D)\\land\n\\mathrm{ZfcTop5Closure}_S(X,\\tau,D,X))\\right)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}separable\\text{-}compatible}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{Separable}(X,\\tau)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Separable}_S(X,\\tau)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}separable\\text{-}compatible}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{Separable}(X,\\tau)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Separable}_S(X,\\tau)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Separable: contains countable dense subset</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb{R}^n\">\\(\\mathbb{R}^n\\)</span> is separable for each finite <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span></li>\n<li>第二可数推出可分、可分度量空间具有 Lindelöf 性都是后续定理，不属于本定义。</li>\n<li>Non-separable: discrete uncountable space, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb{R}^{\\mathbb{R}}\">\\(\\mathbb{R}^{\\mathbb{R}}\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Reference\">[Reference]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Munkres, Topology</li>\n<li>Engelking, General Topology</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Reference","text":"[Reference]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch12/58-df-topological-space.md","status":"resolved","id":"815e63e5071e7b58","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch12/58-df-topological-space.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch14/58-df-countable.md","status":"resolved","id":"1b3610e6aed65b25","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch14/58-df-countable.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch13/58-df-zfc-top5-closure.md","status":"resolved","id":"9ac97ecaeb21258a","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch13/58-df-zfc-top5-closure.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch12/58-df-topological-space.md","status":"resolved","id":"815e63e5071e7b58","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S$ (拓扑空间谓词, see [[../batch12/58-df-topological-space.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch14/58-df-countable.md","status":"resolved","id":"1b3610e6aed65b25","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Countable}_S$ (可数谓词, see [[../batch14/58-df-countable.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch13/58-df-zfc-top5-closure.md","status":"resolved","id":"9ac97ecaeb21258a","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcTop5Closure}_S$ (闭包关系, see [[../batch13/58-df-zfc-top5-closure.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"X,\\tau,D\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Countable}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcTop5Closure}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Separable}_S\\subseteq V^2","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}separable}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Separable}_S(X,\\tau)\\leftrightarrow\n\\left(\\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S(X,\\tau)\\land\n\\exists D\\subseteq X\\;(\\mathrm{Countable}_S(D)\\land\n\\mathrm{ZfcTop5Closure}_S(X,\\tau,D,X))\\right)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}separable\\text{-}compatible}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{Separable}(X,\\tau)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Separable}_S(X,\\tau)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathbb{R}^n","display":false},{"tex":"n","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbb{R}^{\\mathbb{R}}","display":false}],"bytes":1477,"backlinks":[{"id":"49cd84fb97221b46","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\operatorname{Separable}(X,\\tau_d)$ (separability predicate, see [[58-df-separable]])"},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-1138","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch06/58-df-separable.md|58-df-separable]]（batch06）"}],"outgoing":["815e63e5071e7b58","1b3610e6aed65b25","9ac97ecaeb21258a"]}